      "Note": "About 2 s (C8's WIN EFFECT, v4: designer 2026-10-29, 'purple energy burst': all glow, no drawn picture, about half the v3 face's size, on the hole): a violet flash; a pool of violet light, three glowing rings and thin light streaks racing out across the cloth from the hole; a violet light column (a soft glow round a white-hot line, about 2.2 studs) standing on the hole, thin light pillars shooting up round it; soft purple fire tongues (the white energy flame, additive) licking up out of the pocket and again as the column fades; sparks; sparkles round the column; glow motes drifting up. Every layer is born at the hole at or just over the cloth (none under it) and the flat ones lie on the cloth centred on it, so it sits on the pocket from the match camera too. The layers over the cloth (the pool, rings, streaks, the aura and the column) are half blended (LightEmission 0.5-0.7) so they tint the bright cloth violet instead of adding up to white on it from above. No sound.",
